        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2ndアルバム「アルストロメリア/鹿乃」の追加情報が解禁されました！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二张专辑《六出花／鹿乃》的追加情报解禁啦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Additional information on the 2nd album \"Alstroemeria / Kano\" has been revealed!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1106.JPG",
            "media": "2b23715898b3.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hxQuDXVSyJ35IPQjgEhVYKQpgIRExXj12IkUwRD1rLVA9UTB-IEcySDJjZUsgXz5UBAAyQCVley8wbD5cJBo4GG9EEg45cWFrIystBG05eEZhDWIpfV1oEDg8ek9sCyUpcllsHjk6Lg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "この人が作る曲が大好きなの〜〜！！！て、方々に2ndアルバムでも楽曲提供していただくことができました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“这个人写的曲子我超喜欢～～！！！”——这次第二张专辑，也成功拜托到了这位来提供歌曲。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I got songs from the people whose music I absolutely love, the \"I adore the songs this person makes!!!\" kind of people, for the 2nd album too."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "どんな曲か曲名から色々想像してお楽しみにしてください(｀・ω・´)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "歌是什么样子的，大家先看着曲名尽情想象，敬请期待哦(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Imagine what kind of songs they are from the titles, and look forward to them(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
